---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';

---

<MainLayout title="Contributing Guidelines - Staff Portal">
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-gray-50">
    <div class="bg-primary-600 text-white">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-12">
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Contributing Guidelines</h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-primary-100">How to contribute content to Dzaleka Online Services</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-8">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <!-- Code of Conduct -->
        <section class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm p-6 mb-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-6">Code of Conduct</h2>
          <div class="prose prose-lg">
            <p>As a contributor to Dzaleka Online Services, you are expected to uphold our community values:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Respect the cultural diversity and heritage of the Dzaleka community</li>
              <li>Maintain confidentiality of sensitive information and personal data</li>
              <li>Ensure content accuracy and cultural sensitivity in all contributions</li>
              <li>Support community empowerment through your work</li>
              <li>Follow ethical guidelines for content creation and sharing</li>
              <li>Respect intellectual property rights and proper attribution</li>
              <li>Maintain professional communication in all interactions</li>
              <li>Contribute to a safe and inclusive environment for all community members</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-gray-600">By participating in this project, you agree to uphold these values and contribute positively to the Dzaleka community.</p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Content Structure -->
        <section class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm p-6 mb-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-6">Content Structure</h2>
          <div class="prose prose-lg">
            <h3>Content Collections</h3>
            <p>All content is organized in the <code>src/content</code> directory with the following collections:</p>
            <ul>
              <li><code>news/</code> - News articles and announcements</li>
              <li><code>events/</code> - Community events and activities</li>
              <li><code>services/</code> - Service directory listings</li>
              <li><code>resources/</code> - Educational and community resources</li>
              <li><code>stories/</code> - Community stories and experiences</li>
              <li><code>photos/</code> - Photo gallery and visual content</li>
              <li><code>jobs/</code> - Job opportunities and listings</li>
              <li><code>community-voices/</code> - Community perspectives and opinions</li>
              <li><code>talents/</code> - Showcase of community talents</li>
              <li><code>gallery/</code> - Visual content and media</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>File Organization</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Use kebab-case for filenames (e.g., <code>my-article.md</code>)</li>
              <li>Place files in their appropriate collection directory</li>
              <li>Use descriptive filenames that reflect the content</li>
              <li>Include proper frontmatter for all content files</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Content Guidelines -->
        <section class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm p-6 mb-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-6">Content Guidelines</h2>
          <div class="prose prose-lg">
            <h3>Markdown Format</h3>
            <div class="bg-gray-800 text-gray-100 p-4 rounded-lg overflow-x-auto">
              <pre class="text-sm font-mono">---
title: Your Title
description: Brief description of the content
date: YYYY-MM-DD
author: Author Name
category: Category Name
tags: [tag1, tag2, tag3]
image: /path/to/image.jpg
---

Your content here...</pre>
            </div>

            <h3>Required Frontmatter</h3>
            <ul>
              <li><code>title</code> - Clear and descriptive title</li>
              <li><code>description</code> - Brief summary of the content</li>
              <li><code>date</code> - Publication date in YYYY-MM-DD format</li>
              <li><code>author</code> - Content creator's name</li>
              <li><code>category</code> - Main category of the content</li>
              <li><code>tags</code> - Array of relevant tags</li>
              <li><code>image</code> - Featured image path (when applicable)</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Content Types</h3>
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-medium">News Articles</h4>
                <ul>
                  <li>Use clear, concise language</li>
                  <li>Include relevant quotes and sources</li>
                  <li>Add proper attribution for images</li>
                  <li>Follow journalistic standards</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-medium">Events</h4>
                <ul>
                  <li>Include date, time, and location</li>
                  <li>Add registration requirements</li>
                  <li>Specify contact information</li>
                  <li>Include event categories</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-medium">Services</h4>
                <ul>
                  <li>Complete business information</li>
                  <li>Operating hours and location</li>
                  <li>Contact details and social media</li>
                  <li>Service categories and tags</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Media Guidelines -->
        <section class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm p-6 mb-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-6">Media Guidelines</h2>
          <div class="prose prose-lg">
            <h3>Image Requirements</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Format: JPG, PNG, or WebP</li>
              <li>Resolution: Minimum 1200x800 pixels</li>
              <li>File size: Optimize for web (max 500KB)</li>
              <li>Alt text: Descriptive and meaningful</li>
              <li>Attribution: Include when required</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>File Organization</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Store images in <code>public/images/</code></li>
              <li>Use descriptive filenames</li>
              <li>Organize by content type and date</li>
              <li>Maintain proper directory structure</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Review Process -->
        <section class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm p-6">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-6">Review Process</h2>
          <div class="prose prose-lg">
            <h3>Content Review Checklist</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Content follows guidelines and standards</li>
              <li>Frontmatter is complete and correct</li>
              <li>Images are properly optimized and attributed</li>
              <li>Links are working and relevant</li>
              <li>Cultural sensitivity is maintained</li>
              <li>Grammar and spelling are correct</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Submission Process</h3>
            <ol>
              <li>Create content in appropriate collection</li>
              <li>Follow naming conventions</li>
              <li>Include all required frontmatter</li>
              <li>Add proper media and attributions</li>
              <li>Submit for review</li>
              <li>Address any feedback</li>
              <li>Get approval before publishing</li>
            </ol>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  .prose h3 {
    @apply text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mb-2;
  }
  .prose h4 {
    @apply text-base font-medium text-gray-900 mb-2;
  }
  .prose p {
    @apply text-gray-600;
  }
  .prose ul {
    @apply list-disc pl-6 mb-4;
  }
  .prose ol {
    @apply list-decimal pl-6 mb-4;
  }
  .prose code {
    @apply bg-gray-100 px-2 py-1 rounded text-sm font-mono;
  }
  pre {
    white-space: pre-wrap;
  }
  code {
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }
  .bg-gray-800 pre {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .bg-gray-800 code {
    color: #F3F4F6;
  }
</style>